\05625\054 171\0565\054 213\056875\054 180\05625\135\054 \133214\056875\054 171\0565\054 253\0565\054 180\05625\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 3\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0563\0564\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0563\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p4\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o visual do reservat\134u00f3rio deve ser efetuada na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Caso seja constatada a presen\134u00e7a de incrusta\134u00e7\134u00f5es e de outras altera\134u00e7\134u00f5es que possam comprometer a qualidade higi\134u00eanico\055sanit\134u00e1ria da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural devem ser revistas as opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o e adotadas as medidas corretivas necess\134u00e1rias\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 4\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p4c1\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p4c1\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1373\1374\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1373\1374\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p4c2\1374\0563\0564\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133258\0565\054 171\0565\054 297\0565\054 180\05625\135\054 \133298\0565\054 171\0565\054 337\0565\054 180\05625\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 3\054 \042col\042\072 2\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0563\0564\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0563\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p4\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o visual do reservat\134u00f3rio deve ser efetuada na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PP