 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p9c4\1374\0566\0568\042\175\054 \042q\137p9c1\1374\0566\0569\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133175\05625\054 164\0560\054 213\056875\054 173\0565\135\054 \133214\056875\054 164\0560\054 253\0565\054 173\0565\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 8\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0566\0569\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0566\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p9\1374\0566\0569\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A sa\134u00edda do equipamento de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o das embalagens deve estar posicionada pr\134u00f3xima \134u00e0 sala de envase para evitar que as embalagens circulem em ambiente aberto\056 Quando n\134u00e3o for poss\134u00edvel\054 as esteiras devem ser protegidas por cobertura\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\054 \042P\042\072 2\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042O transporte das embalagens da \134u00e1rea de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o para a sala de envase deve ser realizado imediatamente\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 2\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 2\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p9c1\1374\0566\0569\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p9c1\1374\0566\0569\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1376\1379\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1376\1379\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p9c2\1374\0566\0569\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133258\0565\054 164\0560\054 297\0565\054 173\0565\135\054 \133298\0565\054 164\0560\054 337\0565\054 173\0565\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 8\054 \042col\042\072 2\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0566\0569\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0566\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p9\1374\0566\0569\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A sa\134u00edda do equipamento de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o das embalagens deve estar posicionada pr\134u00f3xima \134u00e0 sala de enva