0\135\054 \133298\0565\054 213\0565\054 337\0565\054 223\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 10\054 \042col\042\072 2\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0567\0568\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0567\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p11\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A sala de envase e os equipamentos devem ser higienizados quantas vezes forem necess\134u00e1rias e imediatamente ap\134u00f3s o t\134u00e9rmino do trabalho\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 a higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar o desmonte dos equipamentos na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 3\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p11c2\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p11c2\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1377\1378\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1377\1378\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p11c3\1374\0567\0568\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133342\0565\054 213\0565\054 381\056125\054 223\0560\135\054 \133382\056125\054 213\0565\054 420\05675\054 223\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 10\054 \042col\042\072 3\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0567\0568\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0567\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p11\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A sala de envase e os equipamentos devem ser higienizados quantas vezes forem necess\134u00e1rias e imediatamente ap\134u00f3s o t\134u00e9rmino do trabalho\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 a higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar o desmonte dos equipamentos na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 3\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p11c3\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p11c3\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1377\1378\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1377\1378\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p11c4\1374\0567\0568\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133425\05675\054 213\0565\054 464\05675\054 223\0560\135\054 \133465\05675\054 213\0565\054 504\05675\054 223\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 10\054 \042col\042\072 4\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0567\0568\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0567\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p11\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A sala de envase e os equipamentos devem ser higienizados quantas vezes forem necess\134u00e1rias e imediatamente ap\134u00f3s o t\134u00e9rmino do trabalho\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 a higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar o desmonte dos equipamentos na freq\134u00fc\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 3\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p11c4\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p11c4\1374\0567\0568\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1377\1378\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1377\1378\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0561\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 106\05675\054 577\05625\054 120\05675\135\054 \133528\05625\054 122\05675\054 577\05625\054 136\05675\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0561\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0561\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042O estabelecimento industrial deve implementar e documentar o controle de qualidade da \134u00e1gua mineral natural\054 da \134u00e1gua natural\054 das embalagens e\054 quando utilizado\054 do di\134u00f3xido de carbono\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 4\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0561\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0561\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0562\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 166\05675\054 577\05625\054 180\05675\135\054 \133528\05625\054 182\05675\054 577\05625\054 196\05675\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0562\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0562\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042As an\134u00e1lises laboratoriais para o controle e o monitoramento da qualidade da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural devem ser realizadas em laborat\134u00f3rio pr\134u00f3prio ou terceirizado\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 4\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0562\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0562\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0563\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 227\0565\054 577\05625\054 241\0565\135\054 \133528\05625\054 243\0565\054 577\05625\054 257\0565\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0563\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0563\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042As an\134u00e1lises microbiol\134u00f3gicas e de contaminantes qu\134u00edmicos da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural devem atender ao disposto em legisla\134u00e7\134u00e3o especifica\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 5\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 5\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0563\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0563\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0564\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 288\05625\054 577\05625\054 302\05625\135\054 \133528\05625\054 304\05625\054 577\05625\054 318\05625\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0564\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0564\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042O estabelecimento industrial deve estabelecer plano de amostragem\054 especificando o n\134u00famero de amostras\054 o local de coleta\054 os par\134u00e2metros anal\134u00edticos e a frequ\134u00eancia a ser realizada\054 envolvendo as diversas etapas da industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042O estabelecimento industrial deve executar o plano de amostragem e definir os limites de aceita\134u00e7\134u00e3o a serem determinados nas amostras coletadas\054 segundo o plano estabelecido\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 5\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 5\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0564\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0564\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\13710\1374\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\13710\1374\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0565\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 348\05625\054 577\05625\054 362\05625\135\054 \133528\05625\054 364\05625\054 577\05625\054 378\05625\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0565\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0565\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A \134u00e1gua mineral natural ou a \134u00e1gua natural envasada deve apresentar composi\134u00e7\134u00e3o equivalente \134u00e0 respectiva \134u00e1gua emergente da fonte ou po\134u00e7o\054 conforme especificada nas an\134u00e1lises laboratoriais efetuadas pelo \134u00f3rg\134u00e3o competente do Minist\134u00e9rio das Minas e Energia\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 5\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 5\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0565\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0565\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0566\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 409\0560\054 577\05625\054 423\0560\135\054 \133528\05625\054 425\0560\054 577\05625\054 439\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05610\0566\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05610\0566\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042O estabelecimento industrial deve adotar as medidas corretivas em caso de desvios dos par\134u00e2metros estabelecidos\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 5\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Essas medidas devem estar documentadas\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\054 \042P\042\072 5\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 5\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0566\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05610\0566\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\13710\1376\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\13710\1376\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p12c1\1374\05612\0566\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 469\0560\054 577\05625\054 483\0560\135\054 \133528\05625\054 485\0560\054 577\05625\054 499\0560\135\054 \133528\05625\054 501\0560\054 577\05625\054 515\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 11\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05612\0566\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05610\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 true\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p12\1374\05612\0566\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042O estabelecimento industrial deve dispor de documenta\134u00e7\134u00e3o que comprove a qualidade de cada carga do di\134u00f3xido de carbono\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 2\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 2\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p12c1\1374\05612\0566\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p12c1\1374\05612\0566\042\175\054 \042q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0561\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 106\05675\054 577\05625\054 120\05675\135\054 \133528\05625\054 122\05675\054 577\05625\054 136\05675\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 12\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05611\0561\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05611\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p13\1374\05611\0561\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Os manipuladores de alimentos devem ser supervisionados\054 sendo capacitados periodicamente em\072 higiene pessoal\054 manipula\134u00e7\134u00e3o higi\134u00eanica dos alimentos e em doen\134u00e7as transmitidas por alimentos\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\054 \042P\042\072 2\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 2\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0561\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0561\042\175\054 \042q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0562\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 223\05675\054 577\05625\054 237\05675\135\054 \133528\05625\054 239\05675\054 577\05625\054 253\05675\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 12\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05611\0562\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05611\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p13\1374\05611\0562\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A responsabilidade pela industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural deve ser exercida pelo respons\134u00e1vel t\134u00e9cnico\054 respons\134u00e1vel legal ou propriet\134u00e1rio do estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 2\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 2\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0562\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0562\042\175\054 \042q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0563\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 340\05675\054 577\05625\054 354\05675\135\054 \133528\05625\054 356\05675\054 577\05625\054 370\05675\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 12\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\05611\0563\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\05611\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p13\1374\05611\0563\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A responsabilidade deve ser exercida por funcion\134u00e1rio que tenha realizado curso de capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 com carga hor\134u00e1ria m\134u00ednima de 40 \050quarenta\051 horas\054 abordando os seguintes temas\072a\051 Microbiologia de Alimentos\073b\051 Industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural\073c\051 Boas Pr\134u00e1ticas \073d\051 Sistema de An\134u00e1lise de Perigos e Pontos Cr\134u00edticos de Controle \055 APPCC\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 3\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0563\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0563\042\175\054 \042q\137p13c1\1374\05611\0564\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133528\05625\054 457\05675\054 577\0